    "detailed_description": "A couch co-op or couch multi-player game. Each player controls a snake and eats powerups to get longer.<br><br><strong><u>Snake Adventure</u></strong><br><br>A casual mode to roam and explore several different areas. Up to 4 Snakes for multiplayer. Eat to get longer, then find the door to the next area. You will meet many other snakes on your adventure. Watch out for the Mongoose!<br><br><strong><u>Snake Classic</u></strong><br><br>Classic game of single player snake. Eat to get longer. Avoid the walls and your tail. Get the high score!<br><br><strong><u>Snake Fight</u></strong><br><br>A competitive fight for who is the best snake. Up to 4 Snakes for multiplayer, with AI to fill in. Eat to get longer, and trap the other snakes!<br><br>Update v1.0.1.0: Big fix for Control issues with Shift Key.",
    "about_the_game": "A couch co-op or couch multi-player game. Each player controls a snake and eats powerups to get longer.<br><br><strong><u>Snake Adventure</u></strong><br><br>A casual mode to roam and explore several different areas. Up to 4 Snakes for multiplayer. Eat to get longer, then find the door to the next area. You will meet many other snakes on your adventure. Watch out for the Mongoose!<br><br><strong><u>Snake Classic</u></strong><br><br>Classic game of single player snake. Eat to get longer. Avoid the walls and your tail. Get the high score!<br><br><strong><u>Snake Fight</u></strong><br><br>A competitive fight for who is the best snake. Up to 4 Snakes for multiplayer, with AI to fill in. Eat to get longer, and trap the other snakes!<br><br>Update v1.0.1.0: Big fix for Control issues with Shift Key.",
